From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: po: the Screensavers link of Screen Locking in the edition's nine other languages

The edition's translations of the strings kscreenlocker-screensavers-link.patch adds
(queue row 96), on the 6.7.4 catalogues as the edition has patched them so far.
A first draft made with AI assistance, pending native speakers; KDE's
translation teams take the strings later.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.2
---
diff --git a/po/pl/kcm_screenlocker.po b/po/pl/kcm_screenlocker.po
--- a/po/pl/kcm_screenlocker.po
+++ b/po/pl/kcm_screenlocker.po
@@ -393,3 +393,9 @@
 #: kcm/ui/main.qml:72
 msgid "Also plays after a manual lock while the screen is on. Screen-off and sleep follow Power Management settings."
 msgstr "Animacje są odtwarzane także po ręcznym zablokowaniu ekranu, jeśli ekran jest włączony. Wyłączanie ekranu i usypianie odbywa się według ustawień zarządzania energią."
+
+#: kcm/ui/main.qml
+#, kde-format
+msgctxt "@action:button opens the Screensavers settings page"
+msgid "Screensavers…"
+msgstr "Wygaszacze ekranu…"
